                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "From the creator of \"Thomas Was Alone\"—it’s a stealth/puzzle, but, ugh... it’s a bit of a drag; you can’t really improvise, and you have to memorize the levels, which just doesn’t do it for me. The music feels somewhat out of place. Controller support doesn’t work properly, even though it’s been released on a bunch of different gaming platforms. It feels more like a mobile game than one for PC. \nHonestly, it seems pretty mediocre—or maybe I just failed to grasp its brilliance.",
